== M02's close-out owes the scope guard, and the registration predates the confirmed intent record, so the guard has nothing to judge against. That is a check that cannot happen, and it is never a pass: the dispatch fails at the prompt stage, twice, and the lane is parked with the command that supplies the record; M03 stays held the whole time. Once the intent is confirmed the park releases itself on the next tick and the guard is dispatched ==
